    {
      "line": 4,
      "code": "script_argument <- grep(\"^--file=\", commandArgs(FALSE), value = TRUE)",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        "script_argument"
      ],
      "operation": "commandArgs(FALSE)读取启动参数，grep按^匹配开头，value=TRUE保留字符串。输出零项或一项字符向量，定位Rscript当前文件。",
      "formulaTex": null,
      "dimensions": {
        "script_argument": []
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "code": "source_files <- vapply(sys.frames(), function(frame) if (is.null(frame$ofile)) \"\" else frame$ofile, character(1))",
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        "source_files"
      ],
      "operation": "sys.frames()读取调用环境；vapply逐个返回长度1字符。被source()调用时ofile记录当前脚本路径；没有路径的环境返回空串。",
      "formulaTex": null,
      "dimensions": {
        "source_files": []
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "code": "script_path <- if (any(nzchar(source_files))) tail(source_files[nzchar(source_files)], 1) else if (length(script_argument)) sub(\"^--file=\", \"\", script_argument[1]) else file.path(\"zh\", \"R\", \"ch07.R\")",
      "inputs": [
        "source_files",
        "script_argument"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "script_path"
      ],
      "operation": "if选择来源：source()时取最后一个非空ofile，否则去掉--file=前缀。在项目根R控制台直接运行时，默认使用本讲脚本位置；输出一个路径字符串，[]索引从1开始。",
      "formulaTex": null,
      "dimensions": {
        "source_files": [],
        "script_argument": [],
        "script_path": []
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "code": "stopifnot(length(script_path) == 1L, !is.na(script_path))",
      "inputs": [
        "script_path"
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "operation": "length检查路径只有一项；1L是整数1，!is.na排除缺失。stopifnot要求所有条件为TRUE，否则停止。",
      "formulaTex": null,
      "dimensions": {
        "script_path": []
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "code": "project_root <- normalizePath(file.path(dirname(script_path), \"..\", \"..\"), mustWork = TRUE)",
      "inputs": [
        "script_path"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "project_root"
      ],
      "operation": "dirname取脚本目录；file.path向上两层拼接项目根，normalizePath要求目录存在。路径不依赖当前工作目录。",
      "formulaTex": null,
      "dimensions": {
        "script_path": [],
        "project_root": []
      }
    },
    {
